  "name": "03 - Camera Behavior - Study Orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Study Orchestrator\n- Receives only structured study packages and lifecycle commands.\n- Routes: initialize_study, monitoring_tick, finalize_study, milestone_review.\n- Specialist agents never talk directly to each other.\n\n# Live Preview Rules\n- Preview metrics come from detections + aggregation workflow.\n- Final insights only run at milestone or completion.\n\n# Troubleshooting\n- If needfinding fails, mark the study failed and log workflow_errors.\n- If monitoring batch partially fails, keep successful detections and log per-image errors.\n- If insights fail, keep the study in `insights_running` or `failed` until retry.",
        "width": 820,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
